			"Message": "docs(Rest): Standardize emoji encoding and table formatting in README\n\nReplace emoji characters in `README.md` with explicit HTML entities (e.g., `&#x2001;⛱️`) to ensure consistent rendering across Markdown parsers and prevent parsing errors in SVG containers. Adjust the 'Rest in the Land Ecosystem' section header to align emoji entities with the table structure.\n\nAlso remove Markdown link syntax from the 'Rust API Documentation' line, converting it to plain bold text with the URL embedded directly, to match the project's specific documentation style conventions.\n\nThese changes improve the stability and visual consistency of the Rest component's documentation header and tables.",
