			"Message": "style(Rest): Reformat CLI wrapper and update documentation quotes\n\nReformat `bin/Rest.js` to match the current project style convention: use single quotes for string literals, 2-space indentation, and standardize import ordering. Adjust the CLI execution logic to use a compacted `execSync` call while preserving argument quoting and error handling.\n\nUpdate `Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md` to replace en-dashes (`—`) with hyphens (`-`) in headers and mermaid diagrams to ensure consistent ASCII character usage. Modify the `CompilerConfig` table description to use a hyphen instead of an en-dash for the `useDefineForClassFields` note.\n\nThese changes align the Rest component's documentation and wrapper script with the project's strict formatting standards without altering runtime behavior.",
