			"Message": "docs(Rest): Reformat README.md paragraphs and table alignment\n\nAdjust line wrapping in the main description and 'Why OXC' sections to fit within standard width limits, ensuring better readability on terminal viewers and GitHub. Align the 'Rest in the Land Ecosystem' table columns for consistent visual presentation.\n\nAdditionally, standardize inline code formatting for technology terms (`esbuild`, `VSCode`, `OXC`, `TypeScript`, `JavaScript`) within the table and feature list to match project documentation conventions.\n\nThese changes improve the professional appearance of the Rest component documentation without altering the technical content.",
